      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A CHARMING COTTAGE ON C.0.75 ACRE SITE, IN THE HEART OF NORTH LONGFORDS LAKE DISTRICT ON THE CO. CAVAN BORDER.\r\n\r\nWe take great pleasure here at Davis Auctioneers in taking to the market, this fantastic three-bedroom property, on the borders of Longford and Cavan. Quaint and secluded, this gem suits many, from the first-time buyer market to those seeking the perfect holiday home retreat. \r\n\r\nPerched on a c.0.75 acre site, with space for further development, this fine cottage is situated in a much sought after location on the Longford-Cavan border. A well cared for home, both internally and externally, it is brilliantly located with Arvagh, Colmcille, Dromard and Drumlish, just a few minutes drive away. \r\n\r\nThe residence itself comprises of a living room, raised sitting room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a bathroom. This neatly presented property has huge potential and space for further development, with the county towns of Longford and Cavan less than a 30 minute drive, while 1 hr 35 minutes with take you to Dublin.\r\n\r\nViewing of this property is highly recommended. Please call us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing. \r\n\r\nFolio Number: LD17365F\r\n\r\nEircode: N39 K3H4"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living room: 3.65m x 3.60m\r\n\r\nSitting room: 3.25m x 3.35m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 2.35m x 3.20m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 3.75m x 2.10m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 3.00m x 3.55m\r\n\r\nKitchen: 1.85m x 2.10m\r\n\r\nBathroom/Shower: 1.75m x 2.00m\r\n\r\nNote:\r\nReceipt of these particulars implies an obligation to conduct all negotiations through Padraic Davis Auctioneers LTD. The contents do not constitute an offer or form the basis of any contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition etc, are given in good faith and are believed to be correct. Any intending purchasers should not rely on them and are strongly advised to view the property for themselves. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance purposes only. The boundary markings for this property, outlined in Red, are strictly for guidance purposes only. These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer; they do not form any part of a resulting contract."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Agricultural Outhouse on site\r\n\r\nLarge site with potential for further development\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed Pvc Windows and Doors\r\n\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\n\r\nArvagh, Colmcille, Dromard  and Drumlish just a few minutes drive\r\n\r\nLocated just a 25-30 minute drive to Cavan and Longford\r\n\r\nMoyne Community School just a few minutes’ drive away\r\n\r\nLongford Train Station: 25 Minute drive\r\n\r\n7 Trains a day on the Dublin-Sligo Line\r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 30 mins\r\n\r\nMains Water\r\n\r\nSeptic tank"
      },
